          HIL: |
            <p><img src="data:image/png;base64," width="512"/></p><p class="normal">We are committed to protecting your privacy. If you choose to participate, we will never share your family’s or child’s personal information outside of the study team. We will never include your name in information shared with the government or in any reports. Your name will be kept separately from your answers in a private, secure location. For this interview, it is also important to respect other people’s privacy and not tell anyone else what we talked about today. With all research, there’s a small chance that someone else might get to see your data. We do our best to prevent that, but if it happens, we’ll let you know as soon as possible.</p><p class="normal">Aside from this, there are no other risks to you if you take part in this study. As a benefit of the research, the knowledge gained may help the government and DOH better support your healthcare needs. We shall also provide Php 100 as a token of appreciation for the time you’ve shared with us.</p><p class="normal">Nothing bad will happen if you do not want to be in this study. You can decide to stop the interview at any time. You will never have to pay anything to be in the study.</p><p class="normal">Do you have any questions about the study or about what I have told you?</p><p class="normal">If you have concerns or questions about your rights as a participant, you can contact:</p><p class="normal"><b>Single Joint Research Ethics Board (SJREB) | Department of Health</b><br/>Email: sjreb@doh.gov.ph<br/>Contact No.: (02) 8651-7800 local 1326, 1328</p><p class="normal"><b>Department of Health</b><br/>Name: Lindsley Jeremiah D. Villarante<br/>Email: ldvillarante@doh.gov.ph<br/>Tel: +63 (02) 8651-7800 local 1432</p><p class="normal"><b>Asian Social Project Services, Inc.</b><br/>Name: Paulyn Jean A. Claro<br/>Email: inquiry.aspsi.doh.uhc.survey2@gmail.com<br/>Tel: +63 917 819 6884</p><p class="instruction"><b>Universal Health Care (UHC) Survey-Year 2</b> &middot; Reference Year 2026</p><p class="instruction">PSA SSRCS Clearance No. DOH-2651-04 &middot; issued July 2026 &middot; valid until 31 July 2027<br/>SJREB: ICF ver. 07/25/2026 &middot; Translated Questionnaire ver. 06/05/2026</p>
          ILO: |
            <p><img src="data:image/png;base64," width="512"/></p><p class="normal">We are committed to protecting your privacy. If you choose to participate, we will never share your family’s or child’s personal information outside of the study team. We will never include your name in information shared with the government or in any reports. Your name will be kept separately from your answers in a private, secure location. For this interview, it is also important to respect other people’s privacy and not tell anyone else what we talked about today. With all research, there’s a small chance that someone else might get to see your data. We do our best to prevent that, but if it happens, we’ll let you know as soon as possible.</p><p class="normal">Aside from this, there are no other risks to you if you take part in this study. As a benefit of the research, the knowledge gained may help the government and DOH better support your healthcare needs. We shall also provide Php 100 as a token of appreciation for the time you’ve shared with us.</p><p class="normal">Nothing bad will happen if you do not want to be in this study. You can decide to stop the interview at any time. You will never have to pay anything to be in the study.</p><p class="normal">Do you have any questions about the study or about what I have told you?</p><p class="normal">If you have concerns or questions about your rights as a participant, you can contact:</p><p class="normal"><b>Single Joint Research Ethics Board (SJREB) | Department of Health</b><br/>Email: sjreb@doh.gov.ph<br/>Contact No.: (02) 8651-7800 local 1326, 1328</p><p class="normal"><b>Department of Health</b><br/>Name: Lindsley Jeremiah D. Villarante<br/>Email: ldvillarante@doh.gov.ph<br/>Tel: +63 (02) 8651-7800 local 1432</p><p class="normal"><b>Asian Social Project Services, Inc.</b><br/>Name: Paulyn Jean A. Claro<br/>Email: inquiry.aspsi.doh.uhc.survey2@gmail.com<br/>Tel: +63 917 819 6884</p><p class="instruction"><b>Universal Health Care (UHC) Survey-Year 2</b> &middot; Reference Year 2026</p><p class="instruction">PSA SSRCS Clearance No. DOH-2651-04 &middot; issued July 2026 &middot; valid until 31 July 2027<br/>SJREB: ICF ver. 07/25/2026 &middot; Translated Questionnaire ver. 06/05/2026</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q1_IS_HH_HEAD
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>Before proceeding to the survey proper, we would like to ask you some personal information.</p><p>1. Before we begin, to confirm, are you the household head?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Respondent Profile. The respondent should be the main-decision maker of the household. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>information Bago magpatuloy sa mismong survey, nais naming humingi ng ilang personal na impormasyon mula sa iyo</p><p>Bago tayo magsimula, upang makumpirma, kayo po ba ang pinuno ng sambahayan?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Respondent Profile. The respondent should be the main-decision maker of the household. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Before proceeding to the survey proper, we would like to ask you some personal information.</p><p>Bago kita mag-poon, para makumpirma: ika ba an pasyente?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Respondent Profile. The respondent should be the main-decision maker of the household. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>information Sa dili pa kita mopadayon sa aktuwal nga survey, gusto namo mangayo og pipila ka personal nga impormasyon</p><p>Sa dili pa kita magsugod, aron makompirma, ikaw ba ang punoan sa panimalay?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Respondent Profile. The respondent should be the main-decision maker of the household. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Before proceeding to the survey proper, we would like to ask you some personal information.</p><p>Sa wala pa ta magsugod, ikaw ba ang ulo sa panimalay?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Respondent Profile. The respondent should be the main-decision maker of the household. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>information Antes magpadayon ha survey proper, karuyag namon magpakiana ha iyo hin pipira nga personal nga impormasyon</p><p>Ugsa kita magtikang, para la makasiguro, ikaw ba an ulo han panimalay?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Respondent Profile. The respondent should be the main-decision maker of the household. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Antes magpadayon sa husto nga survey, luyag namon nga mangayo sang pila ka personal nga impormasyon sa imo</p><p>Antes kita magsugod, agud makumpirmar, ikaw bala ang ulo sang panimalay?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Respondent Profile. The respondent should be the main-decision maker of the household. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Before proceeding to the survey proper, we would like to ask you some personal information.</p><p>Sakbay a mangrugitayo, tapno mapasingkedan, sika kadi ti ulo ti sangakabbalayan?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Respondent Profile. The respondent should be the main-decision maker of the household. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.RESPONDENT_NAME
