            <p>Ania ti seksom iti pannakayanakmo?</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q4_LGBTQIA
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>4. Are you part of the LGBTQIA+ community? (e.g., gay, lesbian, bisexual, etc.). It is fine if you are not comfortable answering.</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>4. Are you part of the LGBTQIA+ community? (e.g., gay, lesbian, bisexual, etc.). It is fine if you are not comfortable answering.</p><p class="instruction">BASAHIN ANG PAGPIPILIAN NANG MALAKAS. PUMILI NG ISANG SAGOT LAMANG</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>4. Are you part of the LGBTQIA+ community? (e.g., gay, lesbian, bisexual, etc.). It is fine if you are not comfortable answering.</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>4. Are you part of the LGBTQIA+ community? (e.g., gay, lesbian, bisexual, etc.). It is fine if you are not comfortable answering.</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>4. Are you part of the LGBTQIA+ community? (e.g., gay, lesbian, bisexual, etc.). It is fine if you are not comfortable answering.</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>4. Are you part of the LGBTQIA+ community? (e.g., gay, lesbian, bisexual, etc.). It is fine if you are not comfortable answering.</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA HA MAKUSOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILI MA USA LA NA BATON</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>4. Are you part of the LGBTQIA+ community? (e.g., gay, lesbian, bisexual, etc.). It is fine if you are not comfortable answering.</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>4. Are you part of the LGBTQIA+ community? (e.g., gay, lesbian, bisexual, etc.). It is fine if you are not comfortable answering.</p><p class="instruction">(BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN TI MAYSA LAENG A SUNGBAT.)</p>
