  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q7_IS_PWD
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>7. Do you identify as a person with a disability?</p><p class="instruction">DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Kinikilala ba ninyo ang sarili bilang isang taong may kapansanan?</p><p class="instruction">HUWAG BASAHIN NANG MALAKAS ANG MGA PAMIMILIAN. PUMILI LAMANG NG ISANG SAGOT</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>May mental o pisikal ka bang kapansanan?</p><p class="instruction">DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Giila ba nimo ang imong kaugalingon isip usa ka tawo nga adunay disability?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON OG KUSOG. PILI OG USA KA TUBAG LAMANG</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Nagpaila ba ka isip usa ka tawo nga adunay kapansanan/PWD?</p><p class="instruction">DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Nagpapakilala ka ba nga tawo nga mayda kapansanan?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA HA DAKU NGA TINGOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILI MAUSA LA NGA BATON</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ginakilala mo bala ang imo kaugalingon bilang isa ka tawo nga may disabilidad?</p><p class="instruction">DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>7. Do you identify as a person with a disability?</p><p class="instruction">(SAAN A BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN TI MAYSA LAENG A SUNGBAT.)</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q8_SPECIFY_DISABILITY
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>8. Would you like to specify the type of disability?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Nais mo bang tukuyin ang uri ng kapansanan?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Muya mo ba ispecify ang klase kan saimong kapansanan?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Gusto ba nimo isulti kung unsa klase ang imong disability?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Gusto ba nimo isulti kung unsa nga klase sa kapansanan?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Karuyag mo ba iyakan ano nga klase nga kapansanan?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Gusto mo bala nga ispecify ang tipo sang imo kapansanan?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>8. Would you like to specify the type of disability?</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q9_PWD_CARD
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>9. May we view your PWD Identification Card?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Maaari ba naming makita ang iyong PWD Identification Card?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Pwede mi ba mahiling an saimong PWD ID Card?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Pwede ba namo makita ang imong PWD Identification Card?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Pwede ba kami makakita sa imong PWD Identification Card?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Puwede ba namon kitaon an imo PWD identification Card?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Pwede bala namon makita ang imo PWD Identification Card?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>9. May we view your PWD Identification Card?</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q10_DISABILITY_TYPE
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>10. Based on the presented PWD Identification Card, what type of disability is indicated?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Instruction (DO NOT READ ALOUD): If the PWD Identification Card is presented, record the type of disability as indicated on the card. Do not ask the respondent directly.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>10. Based on the presented PWD Identification Card, what type of disability is indicated?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Instruction (DO NOT READ ALOUD): If the PWD Identification Card is presented, record the type of disability as indicated on the card. Do not ask the respondent directly.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>10. Based on the presented PWD Identification Card, what type of disability is indicated?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Instruction (DO NOT READ ALOUD): If the PWD Identification Card is presented, record the type of disability as indicated on the card. Do not ask the respondent directly.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>10. Based on the presented PWD Identification Card, what type of disability is indicated?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Instruction (DO NOT READ ALOUD): If the PWD Identification Card is presented, record the type of disability as indicated on the card. Do not ask the respondent directly.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>10. Based on the presented PWD Identification Card, what type of disability is indicated?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Instruction (DO NOT READ ALOUD): If the PWD Identification Card is presented, record the type of disability as indicated on the card. Do not ask the respondent directly.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>10. Based on the presented PWD Identification Card, what type of disability is indicated?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Instruction (DO NOT READ ALOUD): If the PWD Identification Card is presented, record the type of disability as indicated on the card. Do not ask the respondent directly.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>10. Based on the presented PWD Identification Card, what type of disability is indicated?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Instruction (DO NOT READ ALOUD): If the PWD Identification Card is presented, record the type of disability as indicated on the card. Do not ask the respondent directly.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>10. Based on the presented PWD Identification Card, what type of disability is indicated?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Instruction (DO NOT READ ALOUD): If the PWD Identification Card is presented, record the type of disability as indicated on the card. Do not ask the respondent directly.</p>
