            <p>13. What is your main source of income?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. IF MORE THAN ONE, ASK FOR THE MAIN SOURCE.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Ano ang iyong pangunahing pinagkukunan ng kita?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. IF MORE THAN ONE, ASK FOR THE MAIN SOURCE.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Ano an pinagkukuhan mo nin pagkabuhay o kita?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. IF MORE THAN ONE, ASK FOR THE MAIN SOURCE.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Unsa ang imong pinakadako nga gikuhaan sa kita?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. IF MORE THAN ONE, ASK FOR THE MAIN SOURCE.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Unsa ang nag-unang tinubdan sa imong kita?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. IF MORE THAN ONE, ASK FOR THE MAIN SOURCE.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Ano an imo nangunguna nga pinagkukuhaan hin kita?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. IF MORE THAN ONE, ASK FOR THE MAIN SOURCE.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ano ang naga panguna nga ginahalinan sang imo kita?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. IF MORE THAN ONE, ASK FOR THE MAIN SOURCE.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>13. What is your main source of income?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. IF MORE THAN ONE, ASK FOR THE MAIN SOURCE.</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q14_IP_MEMBER
