  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q30_NAME
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will now ask for some personal information about your household members.</p><p>30. Name (LAST NAME, FIRST NAME &amp; MIDDLE NAME, EXT)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the characteristics of the Household. The respondent can answer on behalf of the household member. However, if the household member is present during the interview, they may provide their answers. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. For the enumerator: please check that the total number is equal to the number answered in Q19.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Magtatanong na kami ngayon ng ilang personal na impormasyon tungkol sa mga miyembro ng inyong sambahayan</p><p>30. Name (LAST NAME, FIRST NAME &amp; MIDDLE NAME, EXT)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the characteristics of the Household. The respondent can answer on behalf of the household member. However, if the household member is present during the interview, they may provide their answers. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. For the enumerator: please check that the total number is equal to the number answered in Q19.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot kami ki pirang personal na impormasyon manungod kan mga miyembro kan saindong pamilya</p><p>30. Name (LAST NAME, FIRST NAME &amp; MIDDLE NAME, EXT)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the characteristics of the Household. The respondent can answer on behalf of the household member. However, if the household member is present during the interview, they may provide their answers. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. For the enumerator: please check that the total number is equal to the number answered in Q19.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana na kami karon og pipila ka personal nga impormasyon bahin sa mga miyembro sa inyong panimalay</p><p>30. Name (LAST NAME, FIRST NAME &amp; MIDDLE NAME, EXT)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the characteristics of the Household. The respondent can answer on behalf of the household member. However, if the household member is present during the interview, they may provide their answers. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. For the enumerator: please check that the total number is equal to the number answered in Q19.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>We will now ask for some personal information about your household members.</p><p>30. Name (LAST NAME, FIRST NAME &amp; MIDDLE NAME, EXT)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the characteristics of the Household. The respondent can answer on behalf of the household member. However, if the household member is present during the interview, they may provide their answers. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. For the enumerator: please check that the total number is equal to the number answered in Q19.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Mangaro kami yana hin pipira nga personal nga impormasyon mahitungod han iyo mga kapamilya</p><p>30. Name (LAST NAME, FIRST NAME &amp; MIDDLE NAME, EXT)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the characteristics of the Household. The respondent can answer on behalf of the household member. However, if the household member is present during the interview, they may provide their answers. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. For the enumerator: please check that the total number is equal to the number answered in Q19.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Magapamangkot kami subong sang pila ka personal nga impormasyon parte sa mga miembro sang inyo panimalay</p><p>30. Name (LAST NAME, FIRST NAME &amp; MIDDLE NAME, EXT)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the characteristics of the Household. The respondent can answer on behalf of the household member. However, if the household member is present during the interview, they may provide their answers. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. For the enumerator: please check that the total number is equal to the number answered in Q19.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>We will now ask for some personal information about your household members.</p><p>30. Name (LAST NAME, FIRST NAME &amp; MIDDLE NAME, EXT)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the characteristics of the Household. The respondent can answer on behalf of the household member. However, if the household member is present during the interview, they may provide their answers. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. For the enumerator: please check that the total number is equal to the number answered in Q19.</p>
