  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q51_UHC_HEARD
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC).</p><p>51. Have you heard about Universal Health Care (UHC) prior to this survey?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC). Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Magtatanong kami ngayon tungkol sa inyong kaalaman sa Universal Health Care (UHC)</p><p>Narinig na ba ninyo ang tungkol sa Universal Health Care (UHC) bago ang survey na ito?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC). Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot na kami manungod sa saimong kaaraman sa Universal Health Crae (UHC) Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for</p><p>Nadangog o naaraman mo na ang manungod sa Universal Health Care (UHC) bago pa sa survey na ini?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC). Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana kami karon bahin sa imong kahibalo sa Universal Health Care (UHC)</p><p>Nakadungog na ba ka bahin sa Universal Health Care (UHC) sa wala pa kining survey?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC). Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC).</p><p>Nakadungog na ba ka mahitungod sa Universal Health Care (UHC) sa wala pa kining survey?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC). Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC).</p><p>Nabatian mo na ba an mahitungod han Universal Health Care (UHC) antes hini nga surbey?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC). Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Karun pangayuon namon ang imo kahibalo parte sa Universal Health Care (UHC)</p><p>Nakabati ka na bala sang Universal Health Care (UHC antes sini nga survey)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC). Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Saludsodenmi itan ti maipapan iti pannakaammoyo iti Universal Health Care (UHC)</p><p>Nangngegyo kadin ti maipapan iti Universal Health Care (UHC) sakbay daytoy a surbey?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC). Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q52_UHC_SOURCE
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>52. What is your source of information about UHC?</p><p class="instruction">DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ALL THAT APPLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Ano po ang inyong pinagkukunan ng impormasyon tungkol sa UHC?</p><p class="instruction">HUWAG BASAHIN NG MALAKAS ANG MGA OPSYON. PUMILI NG LAHAT NG NAANGKOP</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>52. What is your source of information about UHC?</p><p class="instruction">DAE PAGBASAHON NIN MAKSUOG. PILION AN DAPAT NA KASIMBAGAN</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Asa nimo nadungog o nakuha ang impormasyon bahin sa UHC?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILI-A ANG TANAN NGA PWEDE</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Unsa ang imong tinubdan sa impormasyon bahin sa UHC?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA UG KUSOG. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA MO APPLY</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>53. Ano an iyo ginkukuhaan hin impormasyon mahitungod han UHC?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW PAGBASA HA MAKUSOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILIA AN TANAN NGA APLIKADO</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ano ang imo ginhalinan sang impormasyon parte sa UHC?</p><p class="instruction">INDI PAGBASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA NAGA‑KABAGAY</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Ania ti gubuayan ti impormasionmo maipapan iti UHC?)</p><p class="instruction">(SAAN A BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN AMIN NGA AGaplikar.)</p>
