            <p>Does this area have a Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center? (Q57-Q61 apply only to areas with a BUCAS center.)</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Does this area have a Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center? (Q57-Q61 apply only to areas with a BUCAS center.)</p>
          BCL: |
