  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q57_BUCAS_HEARD
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center.</p><p>57. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Service (BUCAS) center?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. Q57 to Q61 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Magtatanong kami ngayon tungkol sa inyong kaalaman sa BUCAS at sa mga serbisyong inyong nagamit sa isang BUCAS Center</p><p>Narinig na ba ninyo ang Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Service (BUCAS)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. Q57 to Q61 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot na kami manungod sa saimong kaaraman mo sa BUCAS asin iba pang serbisyo na igwa kang access sa BUCAS Center Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awarenes</p><p>Nadangog mo na ba an Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Service (BUCAS)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. Q57 to Q61 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana kami karon bahin sa imong kahibalo sa BUCAS ug sa mga serbisyo nga imong nakuha sa usa ka BUCAS Center</p><p>Nakadungog na ba ka bahin sa "Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Service (BUCAS)" sa wala pa kining survey?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. Q57 to Q61 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center.</p><p>Nakadungog na ba ka bahin sa Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. Q57 to Q61 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Magpapakiana kami yana parti han iyo pag-aram han BUCAS ngan han mga serbisyo nga iyo na-access ha usa nga BUCAS Center</p><p>Nakabati ka ba mahitungod han Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Service (BUCAS) center?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. Q57 to Q61 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Pamangkoton namon subong ang imo kahibalo parte sa BUCAS kag ang mga serbisyo nga imo gin‑akses sa BUCAS Center</p><p>Nakabati ka na bala sang Bagong Urgent Care kag Ambulatory Service (BUCAS) center?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. Q57 to Q61 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center.</p><p>Nangngegyo kadin ti maipapan iti sentro ti Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Service (BUCAS)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for awareness of the BUCAS and the services you have accessed in a BUCAS Center. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. Q57 to Q61 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS.</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q58_BUCAS_SOURCE
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>58. If yes, what are your sources of information about this BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ALL THAT APPLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Kung oo, ano po ang inyong pinagkukunan ng impormasyon tungkol sa BUCAS?</p><p class="instruction">HUWAG BASAHIN NG MALAKAS ANG MGA OPSYON. PUMILI NG LAHAT NG NAANGKOP</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Kun iyo, ano an pinanhalian kan impormasyon manungod sa BUCAS?</p><p class="instruction">DAE PAGBASAHON NIN MAKSUOG. PILION AN DAPAT NA KASIMBAGAN</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Kung oo, asa sa nimo nadungog o nakuha ang impormasyon bahin sa YAKAP/Konsulta package?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILI-A ANG TANAN NGA PWEDE</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Kung oo, unsa ang imong mga tinubdan sa impormasyon mahitungod niini nga BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA UG KUSOG. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA MO APPLY</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>58. Kun oo, ano an iyo mga pinagkuhaan hin impormasyon mahitungod hini nga sentro han BUCAS?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW PAGBASA HA MAKUSOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILIA AN TANAN NGA APLIKADO</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Kon ‘Oo’, ano ang imo ginhalinan sang impormasyon parte sa sini nga BUCAS center?”</p><p class="instruction">INDI PAGBASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA NAGA‑KABAGAY</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>No wen, ania dagiti gubuayan ti impormasionyo maipapan iti daytoy a sentro ti BUCAS?)</p><p class="instruction">(SAAN A BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN AMIN NGA AGaplikar.)</p>
