  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q68_PHARMACY_ACCESS
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>68. How easy is it for you to access a pharmacy or drugstore?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Gaano kadali para sa iyo ang makapunta sa isang botika o drugstore?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Gano kadali saimo na maka-access nin pharmacy o drugstore?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Unsa ka sayon para nimo ang pag-access sa botika o drugstore?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Unsa kadali alang kanimo ang pag-adto sa botika o drugstore?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Mationan-o kadali para ha imo an pagsulod ha usa nga botika?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ano ka hapos para sa imo ang pag‑akses sa botika ukon drugstore?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Kasano kalalaka para kenka a makastrek iti botika wenno botika?</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.AREA_HAS_GAMOT
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>Does this area have a Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) pharmacy/package? (Q69-Q76 apply only to areas with GAMOT.)</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Does this area have a Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) pharmacy/package? (Q69-Q76 apply only to areas with GAMOT.)</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Does this area have a Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) pharmacy/package? (Q69-Q76 apply only to areas with GAMOT.)</p>
          BIS: |
