  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q79_REG_SOURCE
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>The next questions we will be asking are related your PhilHealth registration experience. We will also confirm your PhilHealth registration status and membership.</p><p>79. How did you find out about how to register to PhilHealth?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for PhilHealth registration experience and registration status and membership. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Ang mga susunod na tanong ay may kaugnayan sa iyong karanasan sa pagpaparehistro sa PhilHealth</p><p>Paano po ninyo nalaman kung paano magparehistro sa PhilHealth?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for PhilHealth registration experience and registration status and membership. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>An masunod na kahapotan manungod sa Philhealth registration na saimong naeksperyensyahan</p><p>Pano mo naaraman kun pano magrehistro sa PhilHealth?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for PhilHealth registration experience and registration status and membership. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Ang sunod nga mga pangutana may kalabutan sa imong kasinatian sa pagparehistro sa PhilHealth</p><p>Giunsa nimo pagkahibalo kung unsaon pagparehistro sa PhilHealth?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for PhilHealth registration experience and registration status and membership. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>The next questions we will be asking are related your PhilHealth registration experience. We will also confirm your PhilHealth registration status and membership.</p><p>Giunsa nimo paghibalo kung unsaon pagparehistro sa PhilHealth?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for PhilHealth registration experience and registration status and membership. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>An sunod nga mga pakiana nga amon igpapakiana in may kalabutan han iyo eksperyensya ha pagparehistro ha PhilHealth</p><p>Papaano niyo nahibaru-an an parte han pagparehistro ha PhilHealth?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for PhilHealth registration experience and registration status and membership. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ang masunod nga mga pamangkot nga among ipangayo may kaangtanan sa imo eksperyensya sa PhilHealth registration</p><p>Paano ka nakahibalo kon paano magparehistro sa</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for PhilHealth registration experience and registration status and membership. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Dagiti sumaruno a saludsod nga isaludsodmi ket mainaig iti padasmo iti panagrehistro iti PhilHealth</p><p>( Kasano a naammuam no kasano ti agparehistro iti</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for PhilHealth registration experience and registration status and membership. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
