            <p>Unsa nga paagi sa transportasyon ang imong gigamit sa pag-adto sa pinakaduol nga pasilidad sa primary care?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA UG KUSOG. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA MO APPLY</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>94. Ano nga mga/ paagi hin transportasyon an iyo ginagamit kun nagbibiyahe ngadto han pinakahirani nga pasilidad han panguna nga pag-ataman?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW PAGBASA HA MAKUSOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILIA AN TANAN NGA APLIKADO</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ano nga klase sang transportasyon ang imo ginagamitan kon nagabiyahe ka pakadto sa pinakamalapit nga primary care facility?</p><p class="instruction">INDI PAGBASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA NAGA‑KABAGAY</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Ania a wagas/dagiti wagas ti transportasion ti usarem no agbiaheka nga agturong iti kaasitgan a pasilidad ti kangrunaan a panangtaripato?)</p><p class="instruction">(SAAN A BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN AMIN NGA AGaplikar.)</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q94_TRANSPORT_OTHER_TXT
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>94. What mode/s of transportation do you use when travelling to the nearest primary care facility? — Other (specify) text</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>94. What mode/s of transportation do you use when travelling to the nearest primary care facility? — Other (specify) text</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>94. What mode/s of transportation do you use when travelling to the nearest primary care facility? — Other (specify) text</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>94. What mode/s of transportation do you use when travelling to the nearest primary care facility? — Other (specify) text</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>94. What mode/s of transportation do you use when travelling to the nearest primary care facility? — Other (specify) text</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>94. What mode/s of transportation do you use when travelling to the nearest primary care facility? — Other (specify) text</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>94. What mode/s of transportation do you use when travelling to the nearest primary care facility? — Other (specify) text</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>94. What mode/s of transportation do you use when travelling to the nearest primary care facility? — Other (specify) text</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q95_TRAVEL_TIME_MIN
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>95. How long does it take you to travel from your house when going to the nearest primary care facility? (one-way, minutes)</p><p class="instruction">Please note the response for one way only from the time the respondent left their place of residence and arrived at the facility.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>95. How long does it take you to travel from your house when going to the nearest primary care facility? (one-way, minutes)</p><p class="instruction">Please note the response for one way only from the time the respondent left their place of residence and arrived at the facility.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>95. How long does it take you to travel from your house when going to the nearest primary care facility? (one-way, minutes)</p><p class="instruction">Please note the response for one way only from the time the respondent left their place of residence and arrived at the facility.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>95. How long does it take you to travel from your house when going to the nearest primary care facility? (one-way, minutes)</p><p class="instruction">Please note the response for one way only from the time the respondent left their place of residence and arrived at the facility.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>95. How long does it take you to travel from your house when going to the nearest primary care facility? (one-way, minutes)</p><p class="instruction">Please note the response for one way only from the time the respondent left their place of residence and arrived at the facility.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>95. How long does it take you to travel from your house when going to the nearest primary care facility? (one-way, minutes)</p><p class="instruction">Please note the response for one way only from the time the respondent left their place of residence and arrived at the facility.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>95. How long does it take you to travel from your house when going to the nearest primary care facility? (one-way, minutes)</p><p class="instruction">Please note the response for one way only from the time the respondent left their place of residence and arrived at the facility.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>95. How long does it take you to travel from your house when going to the nearest primary care facility? (one-way, minutes)</p><p class="instruction">Please note the response for one way only from the time the respondent left their place of residence and arrived at the facility.</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q96_TRAVEL_COST_PHP
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>96. How much does it usually cost for you to travel to this facility from your home? (PHP, one-way)</p><p class="instruction">Please specify in Philippine pesos. Please confirm the ONE-WAY cost: from house to facility ONLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>96. How much does it usually cost for you to travel to this facility from your home? (PHP, one-way)</p><p class="instruction">Please specify in Philippine pesos. Please confirm the ONE-WAY cost: from house to facility ONLY.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>96. How much does it usually cost for you to travel to this facility from your home? (PHP, one-way)</p><p class="instruction">Please specify in Philippine pesos. Please confirm the ONE-WAY cost: from house to facility ONLY.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>96. How much does it usually cost for you to travel to this facility from your home? (PHP, one-way)</p><p class="instruction">Please specify in Philippine pesos. Please confirm the ONE-WAY cost: from house to facility ONLY.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>96. How much does it usually cost for you to travel to this facility from your home? (PHP, one-way)</p><p class="instruction">Please specify in Philippine pesos. Please confirm the ONE-WAY cost: from house to facility ONLY.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>96. How much does it usually cost for you to travel to this facility from your home? (PHP, one-way)</p><p class="instruction">Please specify in Philippine pesos. Please confirm the ONE-WAY cost: from house to facility ONLY.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>96. How much does it usually cost for you to travel to this facility from your home? (PHP, one-way)</p><p class="instruction">Please specify in Philippine pesos. Please confirm the ONE-WAY cost: from house to facility ONLY.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>96. How much does it usually cost for you to travel to this facility from your home? (PHP, one-way)</p><p class="instruction">Please specify in Philippine pesos. Please confirm the ONE-WAY cost: from house to facility ONLY.</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q97_KNOWS_BOOKING
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>In this section of the survey, I will now ask about how you access care in the last 6 months in a primary care facility. Examples of primary care facilities are RHUs, Health Center, and Barangay Health Station.</p><p>97. When you have a health problem, do you know how to book an appointment at a primary care facility?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Sa seksyong ito ng survey, magtatanong kami ngayon tungkol sa kung paano kayo nakakakuha ng serbisyong pangkalusugan sa nakalipas na 6 na buwan sa isang primary care facility</p><p>Kapag may problema ka sa kalusugan, alam mo ba kung paano magpa-book ng appointment sa isang primary care facility?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Masunod na kahapotan ay manungod sa access care sa nakaaging 6 anom na bulan sa primary care facility</p><p>Kun may health problem ka, aram mo ba kun pan-o magbook appointment sa primary care facility?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Kining bahin sa survey, mangutana kami bahin sa imong pag-access sa serbisyo sa miaging 6 ka bulan sa usa ka primary care facility</p><p>Kung naay problema sa panglawas, kabalo baka unsaon pagpahigayon ug appointment sa usa ka pasilidad?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility</p><p>Kung aduna kay problema sa panglawas, kabalo ba ka unsaon pag-book og appointment sa usa ka primary care facility?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Hini nga seksyon han surbey, magpapakiana ako yana mahitungod han kun tipaunanho kamo nakakakuha hin pag-ataman han naglabay nga 6 ka bulan ha usa nga pasilidad hin panguna nga pag-ataman</p><p>Kun mayda ka problema ha panlawas, maaram ka ba magpa-iskedyul hin appointment ha pasilidad para han una nga pag-antam han kahimsog?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Sa sini nga seksyon sang survey, mangayo kami sang mga pamangkot parte sa imo pagkuha sang pag‑atipan sa sulod sang nagligad nga 6 ka bulan sa isa ka primary care facility</p><p>Kon may ara ikaw sang problema sa ikaayong lawas, kabalo bala ikaw kon paano mag‑book sang appointment sa isa ka primary care facility?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Iti daytoy a benneg ti surbey, damagenko itan no kasano a makagun-odka iti pannakaaywan iti napalabas nga 6 a bulan iti pasilidad ti kangrunaan a panangaywan</p><p>No addaanka iti parikut iti salun-at, ammom kadi no kasano ti ag-book iti appointment iti pasilidad ti kangrunaan a panangaywan?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Access to a primary care facility. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q98_PHONE_ADVICE_OPEN
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>98. When your primary care facility is open, can you get advice quickly over the phone if you need it?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Kapag bukas ang iyong primary care facility, nakakakuha ka ba agad ng payo sa pamamagitan ng telepono kung kinakailangan mo ito?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Kun bukas an primary care facility, pwedeng makakuha advice sa telepono?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Kung abre ang pasilidad, makakuha ka ba dayon ug tambag gamit imong selpon, kung kinahanglan na nimo kaau?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Kung abli ang inyong primary care facility, makakuha ba ka dayon og tambag pinaagi sa telepono kung kinahanglan nimo?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Kun abri na an iyo pasilidad han panguna nga pag-ataman, pwede ba kamo makakarawat hin sagdon dayon pinaagi han telepono kun kinahanglan niyo?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Kon bukas ang imo primary care facility, makakuha bala ikaw sang madasig nga advice sa telepono kon kinahanglan mo?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>No silulukat ti pasilidad ti kangrunaan a panangaywanmo, mabalin kadi a dagus a makagun-odka iti balakad babaen ti telepono no kasapulam dayta?</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q99_PHONE_ADVICE_CLOSED
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>99. When your primary care facility is closed, is there a phone number you can call when you get sick?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Kapag sarado ang iyong primary care facility, mayroon ka bang numero ng telepono na maaari mong tawagan kapag ikaw ay nagkasakit?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Kun sarado an primary care facility, may phone number ka pwedeng apudan?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Kung sirado ang pasilidad, adunay bay number sa selpon nga matawagan kung magkasakit ka?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Kung sirado ang inyong primary care facility, naa bay numero sa telepono nga pwede nimo tawagan kung magsakit ka?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Kun sarado an iyo pasilidad han panguna nga pag-ataman, mayda ba numero han telepono nga matatawagan nga iyo matatawagan kun magkasakit kamo?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Kon sirado ang imo primary care facility, may ara bala sang numero sa telepono nga mahimo mo tawagan kon magamasakit ikaw?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>No naserraan ti pasilidad ti kangrunaan a panangaywanmo, adda kadi numero ti telepono a mabalinmo nga awagan no agsakitka?</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q100_LEAVE_WORK_SCHOOL
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>100. When you have to visit your primary care facility, do you have to take a leave from work or school to go?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Kapag kailangan mong bumisita sa iyong primary care facility, kailangan mo bang mag-leave sa trabaho o paaralan para makapunta?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Kun maduman ka sa primary care facility, kaipuhan mo bang mag-leave sa work o school?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Kung kinahanglan ka moadto sa imong primary care facility, kinahanglan ba ka mo-leave sa trabaho o eskwela?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Kung kinahanglan nimo mubisita sa inyong primary care facility, kinahanglan ba ka mokuha og leave sa trabaho o eskwelahan para makaadto?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Kun kinahanglan mo bumisita ha iyo pasilidad han panguna nga pag-ataman, kinahanglan mo ba mag-leave ha trabaho o eskwelahan para kumadto?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Kon kinahanglan ikaw magbisita sa imo primary care facility, kinahanglan bala ikaw magkuha sang leave sa trabaho ukon eskwelahan agud makakadto?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>No masapul a sumarungkarka iti pasilidadmo iti kangrunaan a panangaywanmo, masapul kadi nga agbakasionka iti trabaho wenno eskuelaan tapno mapanka?</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q101_CHECKUP_FREQ
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will now be asking about you and your household members’ actions taken for health concerns. This includes the type of services and facilities you access for your health and well-being.</p><p>101. How often do you/your household member have a general check-up on your health (i.e., when you feel healthy, without any specific illness)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Household members’ health-seeking behavior and outcomes. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Magtatanong kami ngayon tungkol sa mga ginagawa mo at ng mga miyembro ng iyong sambahayan para sa mga alalahanin sa kalusugan</p><p>Gaano kadalas ka o ang miyembro ng iyong sambahayan ay nagpapasuri ng pangkalahatang kalusugan (hal. kapag pakiramdam ay malusog, walang partikular na sakit)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Household members’ health-seeking behavior and outcomes. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot naman kami saimo asin sa sa mga miyembro kan saimong pamilya manungod sa piggigibo nindo kun igwa kamong mga health concerns</p><p>Pira ka beses ka o miembro kan saimong pamilya nagpapa general check-up sa saimong salud (hal. kun marhay an pakiramdam mo asin mayong espesipikong sakit)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Household members’ health-seeking behavior and outcomes. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana kami karon bahin sa mga aksyon nga gihimo nimo ug sa imong mga miyembro sa panimalay alang sa mga problema sa panglawas</p><p>Kasagaran, kapila ka o ang ubang miyembro sa imong pamilya magpa-general checkup maskin walay sakit nga ginabati?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Household members’ health-seeking behavior and outcomes. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>We will now be asking about you and your household members’ actions taken for health concerns. This includes the type of services and facilities you access for your health and well-being.</p><p>Unsa ka sagad ka/kamo sa inyong panimalay magpa-general check-up sa panglawas (kung himsog mo, walay espesipikong sakit)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Household members’ health-seeking behavior and outcomes. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>well- being. Magpapakiana kami yana mahitungod ha iyo ngan han iyo mga miyembro han panimalay' mga aksyon nga ginhimo para han mga kabaraka ha panlawas</p><p>Mationan-o kaagsob nga ikaw/imo kapamilya in mayda general check-up or general nga check-up han imo panlawas (i.e., kun san-o ka umabat hin kahimsog, waray bisan ano nga partikular nga sakit)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Household members’ health-seeking behavior and outcomes. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Subong mamangkot ako saimo sang impormasyon ang bahin sa inyo kag sa mga miyembro sang inyo panimalay nga ginahimo para sa ikaayong lawas</p><p>Ano ka kamasami nga naga‑pa check‑up ikaw ukon ang miyembro sang inyo panimalay para sa ikaayong lawas (bisan kon nagabatyag sang maayo kag wala sang masakit)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Household members’ health-seeking behavior and outcomes. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Saludsodenmi itan ti maipapan kadakayo ken dagiti tignay dagiti kameng ti sangakabbalayanyo nga inaramid para kadagiti pakaseknan iti salun-at</p><p>Kasano kasansan nga addaanka/ti kameng ti sangakabbalayanmo iti sapasap a panangsukimat iti salun-atmo (i.e., no mariknam a nasalun-atka, nga awan ti aniaman nga espesipiko a sakit)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Household members’ health-seeking behavior and outcomes. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q101_CHECKUP_FREQ_OTHER_TXT
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>101. Checkup frequency — Other (Specify) text</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>101. Checkup frequency — Other (Specify) text</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>101. Checkup frequency — Other (Specify) text</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>101. Checkup frequency — Other (Specify) text</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>101. Checkup frequency — Other (Specify) text</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>101. Checkup frequency — Other (Specify) text</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>101. Checkup frequency — Other (Specify) text</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>101. Checkup frequency — Other (Specify) text</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q102_VISIT_REASON
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ALL THAT APPLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Ano ang pinakamahusay na naglalarawan kung bakit ka o ang miyembro ng iyong sambahayan ay bumibisita sa isang health facility (hal. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHIN ANG MGA PAGPIPILIAN NANG MALAKAS. PILIIN LAHAT NG NAAANGKOP</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Ano an pinaka-rason kung ngata ka o miembro kan saimong pamilya nagduduman sa health facility (hal. RHU, health center, clinic asin hospital)?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHON AN MGA OPSYON. PILION AN DAPAT</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Unsa ang pinaka rason nganong muadto o mubisita ka o ang ubang miyembro sa panimalay sa usa ka pasilidad sa panglawas (RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON OG KUSOG. PILI ANG TANANG PWEDE</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Unsa ang pinakamaayo nga makahulagway nganong ikaw/ang miyembro sa inyong panimalay mobisita sa usa ka health facility (pananglitan RHU, health center, clinic, ospital)?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA UG KUSOG ANG MGA TUBAG. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA MO APPLY</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>102. Ano an pinakamaupay nganagyayakan kun kay ano nga ikaw/imo kapamilya in mabisita ha usa nga pasilidad panlawas (e.g. RHU, sentro han panlawas, klinika, ospital)?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA HA MAKUSOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILIA AN TANAN NGA APLIKADO</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ano ang pinaka‑naga‑laragway kon ngaa ikaw ukon ang miyembro sang inyo panimalay naga‑adto sa pasilidad sang panglawas (sama sang RHU, health center, klinika, ukon ospital)?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA NAGA‑KABAGAY</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Ania ti kasayaatan a mangiladawan no apay a sika/ti kameng ti sangakabbalayanmo ket sumarungkar iti pasilidad ti salun-at (e.g. RHU, sentro ti salun-at, klinika, ospital)?)</p><p class="instruction">(BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN AMIN NGA AGaplikar.)</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q102_VISIT_REASON_OTHER_TXT
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)? — Other (specify) text</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)? — Other (specify) text</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)? — Other (specify) text</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)? — Other (specify) text</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)? — Other (specify) text</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)? — Other (specify) text</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)? — Other (specify) text</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>102. What best describes why you/your household member will visit a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)? — Other (specify) text</p>
  - name: HOUSEHOLDSURVEY_DICT.Q103_CARE_TYPE
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>103. Have you accessed any of the following forms of care in the last 6 months?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ALL THAT APPLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Naka-access ka ba ng alinman sa mga sumusunod na uri ng serbisyong pangkalusugan sa nakalipas na 6 na buwan?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHIN ANG MGA PAGPIPILIAN NANG MALAKAS. PILIIN LAHAT NG NAAANGKOP</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Anong klase kan serbisyo ang na-access mo sa nakaaging 6 anom na bulan?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHON AN MGA OPSYON. PILION AN DAPAT</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Naka-access ba ka sa bisan unsang mosunod nga klase sa pag-atiman sulod sa milabay nga 6 ka bulan?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON OG KUSOG. PILI ANG TANANG PWEDE</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Nakagamit na ba ka sa bisan asa sa mosunod nga klase sa pag-atiman sa miaging 6 ka bulan?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA UG KUSOG ANG MGA TUBAG. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA MO APPLY</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Naka-access ka ba hin bisan hain han mga masunod nga porma hin pag-ataman han naglabaynga 6 ka bulan?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA HA MAKUSOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILIA AN TANAN NGA APLIKADO</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Naka access bala ikaw ukon ang miyembro sang inyo panimalay sang isa sa mga masunod nga klase sang pagbulig sa ikaayong lawas sa sulod sang nagligad nga 6 ka bulan?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA NAGA‑KABAGAY</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Nagun-odmo kadi ti aniaman kadagiti sumaganad a porma ti panangaywan iti napalabas nga 6 a bulan?)</p><p class="instruction">(BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN AMIN NGA AGaplikar.)</p>
