          CEB: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of the No Balance Billing (NBB).</p><p>Nakadungog na ba ka bahin sa No Balance Billing (NBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for No Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Magpapakiana kami yana mahitungod han iyo pag-aram han No Balance Billing (NBB) Note to enumerator [do not read]: This secti</p><p>Nakabati ka na ba han No Balance Billing (NBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for No Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Subong, pamangkuton namon ikaw parte sa imo kahibalo sang No Balance Billing (NBB) Note to enumerator [do not read]: This se</p><p>Nakabati ka na bala sang No Balance Billing (NBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for No Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Saludsodenmi itan ti maipapan iti pannakaammoyo iti No Balance Billing (NBB)</p><p>Nangngegyo kadin ti No Balance Billing (NBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for No Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
