    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of the Zero Balance Billing (ZBB).</p><p>132. Have you heard of the Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Zero Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
