            <p>Magtatanong kami ngayon tungkol sa inyong kaalaman sa Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)</p><p>Narinig niyo na po ba ang Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Zero Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot naman kami manungod sa kaaraman mo sa Zero Balance Billing (ZBB) Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for</p><p>Nakadangog ka na ba kan Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Zero Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          BIS: |
