          CEB: |
            <p>We will now ask about your awareness of the Zero Balance Billing (ZBB).</p><p>Nakadungog na ba ka bahin sa Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Zero Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Magpapakiana kami yana mahitungod han iyo awareness han Zero Balance Billing (ZBB) Note toenumerator [do not read]: This sectio</p><p>Nabatian mo na ba an Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Zero Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Subong, pamangkuton namon ikaw parte sa imo kahibalo sang Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)</p><p>Nakabati ka na bala sang Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Zero Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Saludsodenmi itan ti maipapan iti pannakaammoyo iti Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)</p><p>Nangngegyo kadin ti Zero Balance Billing (ZBB)?</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for Zero Balance Billing Awareness and Utilization. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p>
