          EN: |
            <p>188. Selling of any household's assets or goods (housing, land, animals, jewelry, appliances, or machines)</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Pagbebenta ng anumang ari-arian o produkto ng sambahayan (bahay, lupa, hayop, alahas, appliances, o makina</p>
